<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS2" title="In IV Experiments ‣ RadarLLM: Adapting Pretrained Large Language Models for Marine Radar Target Detection with Preference-aware Loss" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-B</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Comparison of Detection Performance, Speed, and Network Parameters Under Sufficient Training Samples</span></span></a></li>
